ars, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 45% of normal in both January to February and August to September. So far in 2026 it shows 172% in March to April.</p>"}
